WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.820
Another interesting article. But is it worth your time?

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:08.961
Open Attention before you dive in.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:12.668
Your goal. The time you have.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:18.891
A recommendation. A reason. And the reading time.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:25.579
Worth reading, but not right now? Save it for later.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.943
Find it when you’re ready.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:36.867
Attention. Choose what deserves your attention.
